---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: db.regions
  size: 1
  alias: r
permalink: "/regions/{{ r.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ r.name }} climate region"
  description: "What to grow in a {{ r.name | lower }} climate: growing guides, suitable varieties and Köppen classes."
  jsonUrl: "/regions/{{ r.slug }}.json"
---
<p class="crumbs"><a href="{{ '/regions/' | url }}">Climate regions</a> /</p>
<div class="layout">
  <article class="col-main" data-pagefind-body>
    <h1><span class="swatch" style="background:{{ r.color }}"></span> {{ r.name }}</h1>
    {% set img = r.image %}{% set alt = "Typical farmland or gardens in a " + (r.name | lower) + " climate" %}{% set inherited = false %}{% include "image.njk" %}
    <div class="body">{{ r.html | safe }}</div>
    {% if r.examples %}<p class="small"><strong>Examples:</strong> {{ r.examples }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p>Köppen-Geiger classes: {% for k in r.koppen %}{{ k | kgLink(koppen.classes, db.kgToRegion, true) | safe }} {{ koppen.classes | kgName(k) }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>

    <h2>Growing guides for this region</h2>
    {% set primary = r.guides | where("primary", true) %}
    {% set also = r.guides | where("primary", false) %}
    {% if primary.length %}
    {% include "filters.njk" %}
<ul class="crop-grid guide-grid">{% set extraKg = false %}{% for x in primary %}{% set g = x.g %}{% include "guide-tile.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% else %}
    <p>No guides written for this region yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if also.length %}
    <h3>Guides from neighbouring regions that also cover some of these classes</h3>
    <ul class="crop-grid guide-grid">{% set extraKg = r.koppen %}{% for x in also %}{% set g = x.g %}{% include "guide-tile.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% endif %}

    {% if r.varieties.length %}
    <h2>Varieties recommended here</h2>
    <ul class="variety-grid">{% for v in r.varieties %}<li><a href="{{ v.url | url }}"><strong>{{ v.name }}</strong><span>{{ v.cropName }}{% if v.category %} · {{ v.category }}{% endif %}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% endif %}

    <h2>Most similar regions</h2>
    <p>When a crop has no guide for {{ r.name | lower }}, OpenFarm shows the guide from the most similar region, in this order:
      {% for s in r.similar %}{% set sr = db.regionBy[s] %}<a class="chip" href="{{ ('/regions/' + s + '/') | url }}"><span class="swatch sm" style="background:{{ sr.color }}"></span>{{ sr.name }}</a> {% endfor %}</p>

    <p id="help" class="small">Know how to grow something here? <a href="{{ site.repo }}/blob/{{ site.branch }}/CONTRIBUTING.md#add-a-guide">Add a guide for {{ r.name | lower }}</a> – every guide is a plain text file on GitHub.</p>
    {% set editFile = r.file %}{% set editLabel = "Edit this region" %}{% include "edit-button.njk" %}
  </article>
  <aside class="col-side">
    {% include "weather.njk" %}
    <section class="side-card">
      <h3>All climate regions</h3>
      <ul class="region-list">{% for x in db.regions %}<li{% if x.slug == r.slug %} class="current"{% endif %}><a href="{{ ('/regions/' + x.slug + '/') | url }}"><span class="swatch sm" style="background:{{ x.color }}"></span>{{ x.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    </section>
  </aside>
</div>
